    "description": "**Essential** — Baseline hygiene for Azure Update Manager: the non-negotiable controls every deployment should enforce from day one. This tier delivers TLS / HTTPS enforcement preventing in-transit interception and tagging, SKU, and naming controls for cost and ownership accountability. Together these policies protect against credential theft, unencrypted data exposure, and accidental data loss. Maps to CIS Benchmarks, ISO 27001 Annex A.10 (cryptography) and A.12 (operations).",
